<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Scattered showers seen over Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Scattered showers seen over Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Sunday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecasts morning showers along the southwestern coastal areas and evening thundershowers in the Central and Uva provinces on Monday.</p>
</text>
